NOTE FOR HUMAN LEGAL REVIEW (issue #39, needs:legal-review, p0):

This file was added as a safe, reversible default so the repository is not
left with zero license terms. It intentionally does NOT decide Clubika's
final licensing model. A human legal/IP decision is required on at least:

  - Whether "All Rights Reserved" proprietary is the intended final choice,
    or whether Clubika should adopt an OSI license for parts of the code
    (and if so, which one, and for which parts).
  - Whether this file, or any part of the repository, should ever become
    publicly readable — this notice must not be read as authorization to
    change repository visibility. No code path in this change makes the
    repository more visible than it already is.
  - Whether contributor/employee IP assignment terms exist and are
    consistent with the license chosen here.

No AI agent can make this legal determination. Do not treat this file as a
final answer; treat it as a placeholder pending that review.
